            "description": "TeachingPlanController#detail\n\n新增字段：\n- publicFoundation: Boolean\n  - true = 源课 course_Module 为公共基础字典 id（69a7f32e2dc370362ef3ee6e）\n  - 前端据此：隐藏培养方案 tab；objective/tree 可不传 schemeId；courseGraduation 无需按 scheme 切换\n\n其余字段：educationLevel / courseModule / term 已译为中文标签（多值顿号分隔）。"
          },
